# every file in this tree is LF, and that is load-bearing rather than tidy: host/regression.sh and
# scripts/device/*.sh are pushed to an android device and run by /system/bin/sh, where a CR is a
# syntax error rather than whitespace. git for windows ships with core.autocrlf = true in its system
# config, so without this a clone on windows would rewrite them on checkout and the failure would
# land on the device.
* text=auto eol=lf
